; ZacOS 9 System at 1.75x: the font for 1.75x screens (see
; tools/fonts/build_scaled_fonts.py). Drafted by that script from
; platinum-system-12.pfont, and meant to be touched up by hand: it isn't
; regenerated over (but with --force). Same format as the 1x font;
; every glyph drawn at the screen's pixels.

font ZacOS 9 System 1.75x
height 28
baseline 21
cap 16
xheight 12

char space 7 0

